                    "node": {
                        "text": "GET UR TICKETS NOW - 14.11.25 - LINK IN BIO \n\n\u2728\u2b50\ufe0fCosmic Bass is a full-on rave experience - blending colorful trippy visuals, psychedelic atmospheres and alien-like sounds with hard-hitting, soul-shaking bass. It\u2019s a gathering for cosmic ravers, witches, shamans and bass-heads, all coming together to ride the soundwaves, float among UFOs and raise our collective energy\u262f\ufe0f\ud83d\udd49\ufe0f\ud83d\udd2eHere, you can come exactly as you are, and be fully accepted for it\ud83d\udc7d\ud83d\udef8\n\nThis is where Oslo\u2019s underground bass scene meets spacey trance visuals and alien frequencies - an experience unlike anything you\u2019ve felt before. #cosmicbass"
                    }
                }
            ]
